# Breeze-On — Planning Agent (bootstrap)

**Scope:** Breeze-On / BreezeOn only.

**SSOT (read and follow):** https://github.com/Breeze-On/STANDARDS/blob/main/docs/ai/planning-and-development-agents.md

Do not invent local planning/output rules that conflict with STANDARDS.

## Hard requirements (summary)

- New/active plans: `docs/plans/in-progress/<name>.md` only
- Completed plans: move to `docs/plans/implemented/`
- Never render plan content in chat
- After create/update, reply with **only** the path and `[Build Locally]`
- **Delta updates only** — update the existing file; no full regenerations, V2, or duplicates
